---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Fairways & Fences — Golf, County by County"
  description="Fairways & Fences is Honest Acres Group's YouTube series: drone flyovers and rounds at the local golf courses in the Texas counties we serve, reported back for land buyers."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Fairways &amp; Fences</h1>
      <p>
        When buyers ask about a county, they don't only ask about land prices.
        They ask what life there is like. Golf is part of that answer — so
        James is playing the local courses across the counties Honest Acres
        Group serves, and reporting back.
      </p>

      <h2>How each episode works</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>1. Drone flyover</strong> — see the course and the country around it from the air.<br />
        <strong>2. A round with James</strong> — honest course notes, the way you'd get them from a neighbor.<br />
        <strong>3. The county report</strong> — what that course, town, and county offer the people thinking about buying land and living there.
      </p>

      <h2>The pilot episode</h2>
      <p>
        We start at home: <strong>PAR Country Club in Comanche</strong>,
        Comanche County — 18 holes between Comanche and De Leon, minutes
        from James's own ranch country.
      </p>
      <p>
        From there the series works county by county through the Cross
        Timbers and the North Hill Country — Stephenville, Eastland,
        Brownwood, Goldthwaite, Llano, Mason, San Saba, Burnet, Blanco,
        Fredericksburg, and beyond.
      </p>

      <div class="todo-note">
        <strong>Filming note:</strong> every course is contacted for
        permission before any drone or commercial filming. Private clubs are
        featured only with the club's written OK — and that first call is
        also how we meet the neighbors.
      </div>

      <h2>Watch &amp; follow</h2>
      {SITE.social.youtube ? (
        <p>Episodes live on our YouTube channel: <a href={SITE.social.youtube} rel="noopener" target="_blank">Honest Acres Group on YouTube</a>.</p>
      ) : (
        <p>
          {/* TODO: Add the YouTube channel URL in src/config/site.ts once the channel is created. */}
          The series launches with our YouTube channel — follow along on the
          <a href="/blog/"> blog</a> and our social channels for the first episode announcement.
        </p>
      )}
      <p><a class="btn btn-green" href="/county-guides/">See the counties we cover</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
